# Acumen benchmark artifacts. The inputs are tracked (bench/config.yaml, bench/tasks.yaml,
# bench/skills/v*/); the evidence a pass produces is not, because it is large, regenerable,
# and specific to one machine's provider pricing. Run results belong in an artifact store
# or a report attachment, not in git.
